  "id": 233,
  "description": "*Join the Council🦹🏽‍♂️*\n -----------\nIn the heart of Eldoria, nestled deep within the labyrinthine alleyways of the city’s most impoverished quarter, stands the infamous Slums Tavern. Its weathered exterior and dimly lit windows hide the secret headquarters of the Canaglificio, a notorious association of villains. Beer, the scarred and shrewd tavern owner, serves as the gatekeeper, allowing only the most cunning and ruthless to enter.\n\nAdjacent to the tavern lies the Shadow Keep, a sprawling underground fortress. Accessible through a hidden passage behind the bar, the Shadow Keep is a labyrinth of tunnels and chambers where the Canaglificio’s elite members plot their schemes. Within its dimly lit stone walls, the Council of Shadows convenes to make critical decisions, shaping the fate of Eldoria.\n\nJoin Requirement\n -----------\n \n   * *Be active daily* 🏋️‍♀️\n   * *Help the guild with the daily challenges*💪\n\n*Discord 💭*\n-----------\n👉 https://discord.gg/2GJuGWv4HA\n\nIf the link doesn&#039;t work, look for us on the official discord, we will provide you with the new one",
